# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages security headers (ignored by other hosts).
# Safe subset only. A full Content-Security-Policy needs your Bunny/video
# hostnames added first -- see AUDIT.md section "Recommended next steps".
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
